          Home
        </a><li class="v-breadcrumbs__divider"><span class="caption">/</span></li><span class="caption">
            Plans &amp; pricing
          </span></ul> <!----></div> <hr role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="v-divider theme--light"></div>  <div class="container py-10 py-sm-12"><!----> <!----> <div><h1 class="text-center mt-n2 mb-6">
      Choose a plan for your technographics workflow
    </h1> <p class="text-center mx-auto mb-8" style="max-width:600px">
      Start free for website research, then upgrade when you need lead lists,
      CRM enrichment, or API workflows at team scale.
    </p> <div class="mb-1"><!----> <div class="d-flex flex-row align-center body-2 font-weight-medium mb-8 mt-2 mt-md-0"><div class="spacer"></div> <span class="font-weight-regular mr-2">Billing</span> <span>Monthly</span> <div class="v-input my-0 ml-4 always-active-switch v-input--hide-details theme--light v-input--selection-controls v-input--switch v-input--switch--inset"><div class="v-input__control"><div class="v-input__slot"><div class="v-input--selection-controls__input"><input aria-checked="false" id="input-5215" role="switch" type="checkbox" aria-disabled="false"><div class="v-input--selection-controls__ripple"></div><div class="v-input--switch__track theme--light"></div><div class="v-input--switch__thumb theme--light"><!----></div></div></div></div></div> <span>
      Annually <span class="font-weight-regular ml-1">(save 17%)</span></span> <div class="spacer"></div></div> <div class="container matrix__container pl-0 pr-1 mr-n1 pt-2 pb-4"><div class="row matrix no-gutters" style="min-width:800px"><div class="col"><div class="v-responsive" style="height:295px"><div class="v-responsive__content"><div class="v-image v-responsive theme--light" style="width:120px;margin:0 auto;height:100%;transform:scaleX(-1)"><div class="v-image__image v-image__image--preload v-image__image--contain" style="background-position:center center"></div><div class="v-responsive__content"></div></div></div></div> <div><hr role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="v-divider theme--light"> <div class="v-responsive align-center" style="height:50px"><div class="v-responsive__content"><div class="v-card__text py-0">
