                    200,000+
                   <!----></div></div></div></div><div><hr role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="v-divider theme--light"> <div class="v-responsive" style="height:50px"><div class="v-responsive__content"><div class="v-card__text py-2 d-flex justify-center align-center" style="height:100%"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light success--text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span> <!----></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div> <div class="v-dialog__container"><!----></div></div> <div class="v-dialog__container"><!----></div></div> <p class="text-center body-2 mt-5 mb-6">
      Need help choosing a plan?
      <a href="https://www.wappalyzer.com/meet/demo/" target="_blank">
        Talk to sales
      </a></p> <small class="text--disabled">
      Plans can be canceled at any time.<br>
      API credits included in plans expire after 60 days.<br>
      Prices are in United States dollars.
    </small> <div class="mt-8" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto"><div class="v-card v-sheet theme--light primary lighten-1"><div class="v-card__title subtitle-1 font-weight-medium primary--text">Start free
        </div> <div class="v-card__text"><p class="body-2 primary--text">
            Create a free account to get 50 technology lookups every month and
            free sample lead lists before you choose a paid plan.
          </p> <div class="text-center"><button type="button" class="mt-2 mb-2 v-btn v-btn--has-bg theme--light v-size--default primary" style="margin:0 auto"><span class="v-btn__content">Start free</span></button></div></div></div> <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">Frequently asked questions</h3> <div class="body-2"><!----> <!----> <div class="v-item-group theme--light v-expansion-panels v-expansion-panels--flat"><div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">
        Do you offer a free trial?
      <div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          Start with a free account to try Wappalyzer in real workflows. Free
          accounts include 50 lookups and email verifications per month, 5
          website alerts, and free sample lead lists.
        </p></div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">
        Can I make a one-time purchase without a plan?
      <div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap">
        You need a plan to access lead lists, APIs, and CRM integrations.
        Plans can be canceled at any time, which makes them the starting point
        for teams that need ongoing research, enrichment, or automation.
      </div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">Can I pause or cancel my plan?<div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          Yes, you can pause or cancel your plan at any time without losing
          access to your API credits or past purchases.
        </p> <p>
          You may pause your plan for up to three months. During this time you
          won't be billed and API credits included in your plan will not
          expire.
        </p> <p>
          When you cancel, your plan remains active for the remainder of the
          billing period and you can continue using your API credits until
          they expire.
        </p></div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">
        What are Plus features?
      <div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          Plus features extend single-website research. With Plus, you get
          access to available company and contact information in individual
          website lookups, the browser extension, and the Android app.
          <a href="/plus/">See all Plus features</a>.
        </p></div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">What are API credits?<div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          Developers can use our <a href="/api/">APIs</a> to
          connect Wappalyzer to other applications and automate lookups and
          enrichments. Credits are pre-paid usage units for API requests,
          typically 1 credit per website.
        </p></div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">
        When do API credits expire?
      <div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          Credits included in plans expire after 60 days. Credits purchased in
          bundles expire after 365 days. Expired credits can no longer be
          used.
        </p></div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">
        Can I use a different payment method?
      <div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          Most self-serve purchases use credit cards. For larger purchases or
          longer-term commitments, please
          <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> to discuss options.
        </p></div></div></div> <div aria-expanded="false" class="v-expansion-panel"><button type="button" class="v-expansion-panel-header">
        What is your refund policy?
      <div class="v-expansion-panel-header__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate theme--light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon__svg"><path d="M7.41,8.58L12,13.17L16.59,8.58L18,10L12,16L6,10L7.41,8.58Z"></path></svg></span></div></button> <div class="v-expansion-panel-content" style="display:none"><div class="v-expansion-panel-content__wrap"><p>
          If our product does not meet expectations, we will work with you to
          resolve the issue, credit your account, or issue a pro-rata refund.
          Please refer to the
          <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>.
        </p></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div> <div class="mt-10 pa-4 text-center"><a href="https://www.wappalyzer.com/meet/demo/" target="_blank" class="px-12 v-btn v-btn--has-bg theme--light v-size--x-large primary"><span class="v-btn__content">
        Talk to sales
      </span></a></div> </div></div> <div><hr role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="mb-12 v-divider theme--light"> <!----> <!----> <div class="container logos text-center"><p class="overline font-weight-regular">
